  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-01-18T02:57:14.433Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The Nintendo Switch controllers can connect to PC and due to their nature, are quite responsive. So perhaps there is a way to connect them to PC and use them for motion controls in some form? I think it would be a great way to open up a lot of the features of the game to players who can't afford the VR set",
